   "annotation_type": "footnote",
   "annotation_text": "V802 is only for randomized participants who were positive for anti-HBc at screening. All other participants will have their final visit at V801 or ETV.",
   "annotation_text_source": {
    "method": "raster_band_cells",
    "note": "Header-block note printed full width under the table title on every page of the table (read from the clean text layer of document page 46); cell band recovered from raster rule lines. No printed marker in the source - marker n1 synthesised and bound to the V802 header cell the note names."
