   "annotation_text": "Perform only for women of childbearing potential and women with a history of tubal ligation. At dosing visits which have pregnancy testing, the pregnancy test result must be confirmed to be negative prior to dosing. Pregnancy testing may be performed more frequently than designated on the SoA if local laws or regulations require more frequent testing.",
